  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "写入契约",
      "items": [
        "Geometry / Trim / Speed 面板不引用 session.document，经 VC 赋值",
        "裁切改 Segment 源区间；变速改同一 Segment.speed，不另建速度层"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "AlbumTimelineEdit",
      "items": [
        "空 segments = 整段 1x；最多 6 段；时间一律为源媒体 CMTime",
        "Mapper.init(timeline:sourceDuration:) 无状态；Player 只接收 Composition 或入出点"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "needsComposition",
      "items": [
        "阶段 3：段数 ≥ 2；阶段 4：或任一 speed≠1，insert 后再 scaleTimeRange",
        "单段且 1x 仍走原片 CMTimeRange；导出不得再乘一次 speed"
      ]
    }
  ]
